                            PSalvage = RSalvage / (Claim + Deductible + RSalvage + RCost + RSubrogation) * PClaim
                            PCost = RCost / (Claim + Deductible + RSalvage + RCost + RSubrogation) * PClaim
                            PSubrogation = RSubrogation / (Claim + Deductible + RSalvage + RCost + RSubrogation) * PClaim
